  <div class="sh"><h2 class="rv">Great local shops are invisible online.</h2><p class="rv d1">No website, a dozen reviews, wrong hours on Google, a quiet Instagram. <b>A taqueria with 12 reviews loses to the one with 418</b>, even if the tacos are better. IVK fixes the whole online storefront.</p></div>
  <div class="svcs">
   <div class="sv rv"><span>01 · WEB</span><h5>Websites</h5><p>Fast, mobile-first sites with menus, hours, directions and booking.</p></div>
   <div class="sv rv d1"><span>02 · REVIEWS</span><h5>Review stands</h5><p>A counter stand customers tap with NFC or scan by QR to leave a Google review.</p></div>
   <div class="sv rv d2"><span>03 · MAPS</span><h5>Google profile</h5><p>Correct hours, photos, categories and replies, so the shop shows up on Maps.</p></div>
   <div class="sv rv"><span>04 · SOCIAL</span><h5>Instagram</h5><p>Profile setup, posts and reels made for local customers.</p></div>
